  "summary": "In Liberia each university admits its own students; there is no single national placement system. Universities ask for your WASSCE result and most set their own entrance exam. The University of Liberia's entrance exam, run by its Center for Testing and Evaluation, tests English and Mathematics, and candidates who pass then apply to a college.",
